    <string name="onboarding_p1_eyebrow">01 · COMMAND</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p1_title">Email Claude. It runs the task.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p1_body">Send a command to your claude-email service. The service does the work in the project you name and replies when it is done.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_p2_eyebrow">02 · CONVERSATIONS</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p2_title">Threads, not an inbox.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p2_body">Each task is a conversation. Use the Active, Waiting and Archived tabs to switch between them. Swipe a conversation left to archive it.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_p3_eyebrow">03 · ENCRYPTED</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p3_title">Sign-in details stored encrypted.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p3_body">Your sign-in details are stored encrypted, with a key kept in the Android Keystore. The app signs in to your own mail servers and checks them for replies. If you set a shared secret, it is sent with your commands. Android may back up the app\'s data.</string>

