    <string name="setup_header_title">Single mailbox</string>
    <string name="setup_header_body">The app uses one mailbox. It receives mail over IMAP and sends mail over SMTP, the standard ways a mail app talks to a mail provider. Your sign-in details (credentials) are stored encrypted on this phone, with a key kept in the Android Keystore. The app sends them only over encrypted connections, to sign in to your mail servers.</string>
